18
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:11,940
So why does this limit of nine matter for your program?

19
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:16,540
Well, a short list is read at a glance. A long list must be scrolled

20
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:18,920
Which means the wrong value is...

21
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,920
Just one line away, precisely.

22
