23
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,000
Ah, and nobody notices

24
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:28,720
Right. Nobody notices until someone asks where it went.

25
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:32,540
So two short choices are faster and safer than one long one

26
