The categories of each long list are decided once in the interaction design.

30
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:53,320
The analyst proposes them, and, uh, the officers who use the list confirm that each value sits where they would naturally look for it

31
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:54,760
That makes a lot of sense

32
