And twenty is too many for one step?

36
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:19,360
Exactly. The list has three categories. One, licenses, eight matters.

37
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:22,480
Two, suspension and cancellation, seven matters

38
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,420
