44
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:45,000
Step two, seven matters appear, and she picks the one she wants, suspending a full license

45
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:47,560
So she never saw all twenty at once

46
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:48,260
Right.

47
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,920
And she never scrolled past unneeded values

48
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:54,560
To summarize this approach for the application in one sentence, what is it?

49
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:58,700
When a screen offers a long list, ask how it is divided.

50
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:03,940
No step should offer more than nine values, and the officers who use it should agree the categories

